    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.070" end="00:05.270" ttm:agent="v1">Please don't say goodbye, goodbye, goodbye</p>
      <p begin="00:05.270" end="00:10.740" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause my heart keeps coming back</p>
      <p begin="00:10.740" end="00:15.510" ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna cry, no cry, no cry</p>
      <p begin="00:15.510" end="00:19.180" ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna say goodbye</p>
      <p begin="00:19.180" end="00:22.110" ttm:agent="v1">Woah-oh, woah-oh, woah-oh</p>
      <p begin="00:22.110" end="00:24.820" ttm:agent="v1">Said goodbye but she's much too late</p>
      <p begin="00:24.820" end="00:27.540" ttm:agent="v1">Got a girl now and I'm finally straight</p>
      <p begin="00:27.540" end="00:30.050" ttm:agent="v1">Gotta go, don't run up on my way</p>
      <p begin="00:30.050" end="00:32.710" ttm:agent="v1">Nothing down low, I was down, so strange</p>
      <p begin="00:32.710" end="00:37.550" ttm:agent="v1">Don't ever go, I wanna give you all my world</p>
      <p begin="00:37.550" end="00:43.380" ttm:agent="v1">I wanna give everything that I meant to provide</p>
      <p begin="00:43.380" end="00:46.340" ttm:agent="v1">This girl goes down, goes down</p>
      <p begin="00:46.340" end="00:48.760" ttm:agent="v1">Goes down, down, down</p>
