      <p begin="00:50.850" end="00:53.300" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, oh</p>
      <p begin="00:53.300" end="00:54.800" ttm:agent="v1">No good, bae</p>
      <p begin="00:54.420" end="00:56.660" ttm:agent="v1">Good baby, bae</p>
      <p begin="00:56.660" end="01:01.180" ttm:agent="v1">Good bae</p>
      <p begin="01:01.180" end="01:03.760" ttm:agent="v1">Woah-oh, woah-oh-oh</p>
      <p begin="01:03.760" end="01:06.970" ttm:agent="v1">Na-na-na-na-na, na-na-na</p>
      <p begin="01:06.970" end="01:09.510" ttm:agent="v1">Allowed to say goodbye if I'm gonna cry</p>
      <p begin="01:09.510" end="01:11.010" ttm:agent="v1">But I know-</p>
      <p begin="01:10.170" end="01:11.730" ttm:agent="v1">But I know that I should go</p>
      <p begin="01:11.730" end="01:14.100" ttm:agent="v1">But I know that I should go and maybe finding that home</p>
      <p begin="01:14.100" end="01:15.670" ttm:agent="v1">And maybe find another lover</p>
      <p begin="01:15.670" end="01:17.960" ttm:agent="v1">Just wanna go inside my home</p>
      <p begin="01:17.960" end="01:20.830" ttm:agent="v1">And I got a good house like Jerome</p>
      <p begin="01:20.830" end="01:23.400" ttm:agent="v1">And I don't wanna show out like alone</p>
      <p begin="01:23.400" end="01:26.350" ttm:agent="v1">And I don't know but slow how I wanna go</p>
      <p begin="01:26.350" end="01:28.820" ttm:agent="v1">I wanna go, girl, I wanna go, go, go</p>
